# Destination Half-Life game folder for the post-build copy step.
#
# Copy this file to "halflife_path.txt" (same directory) and set the path to a
# WON-era Half-Life (build 1786/1792) install. After each build, hl.exe and
# WONCrypt.dll are copied there so the launcher can be run in place.
#
# - One path, on its own line. Lines starting with '#' and blank lines are ignored.
# - Forward or back slashes both work.
# - If "halflife_path.txt" is missing, the copy step is skipped (no build error).

C:/Games/Half-Life
